<title>USA: FINAL PRICING - Kenton County, Ky.</title>
<headline>FINAL PRICING - Kenton County, Ky.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Sturges Company said it priced $6.340 million of Kenton County, Ky., FHA insured mortgage loan industrial revenue refunding bonds, Series 1997A &amp; Series 1997B.</p>
